oid kicking this can down the road  what happens if we continue to kick this  particular can down the road well I  guess it will mean that our children or  grandchildren will be faced with some  serious choices my personal feeling is  that something is going to have to be  renegotiated with the current retirees  the local governments for example in  Palm Springs of all places are  discovering they're having to do things  like close their Olympic swimming pool  in order to pay for the pension benefits  New York City they now have I think as  many retired policemen collecting  pensions as they have cops on the beat  the whole idea the whole idea of the  pension was to provide public servants  with a decent retirement when they left  public service it wasn't to Manta to  enrich them to make them wealthy to  allow them to retire younger with more  money and be able to go off and play  golf while the rest of us supported them  so I think and this attitude is growing  out there and the public people are  beginning to realize what's been done  and they're not happy about it
 

